{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:ca1f7f63083e649a","name":"The Fell Star (Force Artifact)","source":{"id":"source:reference-ca1f7f63083e649a","title":"The Fell Star (Force Artifact)","revision":22705,"timestamp":"2024-09-06T19:01:20Z","sha256":"cfe376c20b928d67e0a70904ef9e47ba4553985e50533cfc5d30e8f1c5ca1b07","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=22705","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Fell%20Star%20%28Force%20Artifact%29&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-ca1f7f63083e649a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The origin of The Fell Star is a mystery that has been lost to time. The artifact dates to pre-Republic times. Some legends, if uncovered by studious heroes, reveal that The Fell Star was a Sith talisman, but even these tales cannot be verified.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Fell Star is a powerful Force artifact. If worn by a Force-user, it allows the user to regain a spent ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," of their choice as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},"; for each ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," so regained, the user gains one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Point"},". In addition, a Force-user who wears The Fell Star gains a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks made to activate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side"}]},"] descriptor.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
